```c
static int
_compare_idna_map (const uint32_t * c, const uint8_t * p)
{
    IDNAMap map;

    _fill_map (*c, p, &map);

    if (*c < map.cp1)
        return -1;
    if (*c > map.cp1 + map.range)
        return 1;
    return 0;
}
```

This fills the map and compares the code point with the range. This is correct.

